Confirmed @Rames-Jusso's blocker at source, and it's wider than `src`/`href`. Adding only what isn't already in his review.

**The preview rebases three surfaces, not one.** `studio-server/src/helpers/subComposition.ts:33-50` runs all of:

```ts
rewriteAssetPaths(root.querySelectorAll("[src], [href]"), compPath, ..., assetExists);
rewriteInlineStyleAssetUrls(root.querySelectorAll("[style]"), compPath, ..., assetExists);
for (const styleEl of root.querySelectorAll("style")) {
  styleEl.textContent = rewriteCssAssetUrls(styleEl.textContent || "", compPath, assetExists);
